https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus

This product includes software developed at SoundCloud Ltd.
(https://soundcloud.com/).

Ported at upstream v3.13.2 (commit bb5dff00cf8fdfbf5c65e0531aa835fa238a43a2).
The Apache 2.0 license text in LICENSE is Prometheus's own.

Sources ported so far:
  model/labels/{labels_common,labels_slicelabels,labels_stringlabels}.go
  model/value/value.go
  tsdb/encoding/encoding.go
  util/almost/almost.go
  util/kahansum/kahansum.go

Also included: github.com/prometheus/common (Apache 2.0), Copyright The
Prometheus Authors — model/metric.go and model/labels.go validation semantics.

