The Go programming language standard library  —  BSD 3-Clause
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright 2009 The Go Authors
https://go.dev/  —  full text in licenses/go-BSD-3-Clause.txt

Note this is NOT Apache 2.0. Portions of Sources/GoCompat and Sources/PromHash
are translations of Go standard library code, retained here so the port
reproduces Go's exact output:
  strconv/ftoa.go, strconv/decimal.go   -> GoCompat/GoFloat+Format.swift, GoDecimal.swift
  strconv/quote.go, strconv/isprint.go  -> GoCompat/GoStrconv+Quote.swift, Generated/GoIsPrint.swift
  unicode/utf8/utf8.go                  -> GoCompat/GoStrconv+Quote.swift
  encoding/binary/varint.go, binary.go  -> GoCompat/GoVarint.swift
  hash/crc32 (Castagnoli)               -> PromHash/CRC32C.swift

Sources/GoCompat/Generated/GoIsPrint.swift is generated by enumerating runes
through Go's strconv.IsPrint; it is a compressed form of that predicate's data.

