Test fixtures
================================================================================

Fixtures/promql/testdata/*.test are copied verbatim from Prometheus
(promql/promqltest/testdata) and remain under Apache 2.0.

Fixtures/**/*.jsonl are generated by oracle/ from the pinned Prometheus and Go
toolchains; they record those projects' observable behaviour.
